---
title: "senior_watson_selection (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_days: evaluate watson eligibility
    q_check_days --> q_check_points: contest_days >= 28
    q_check_days --> q_ineligible: contest_days < 28
    q_check_points --> q_calc_threshold: compute top5 senior watson average
    q_calc_threshold --> q_threshold_check: threshold = avg_top5_points * 0.25
    q_threshold_check --> q_promoted: watson_points >= threshold
    q_threshold_check --> q_ineligible: watson_points < threshold
    q_promoted --> q_senior_channel: watson added to senior watson discord channel
    q_senior_channel --> q_audit_posted: new audit opportunity posted
    q_audit_posted --> q_signal_interest: senior watson has 72 hours to respond
    q_signal_interest --> q_interest_confirm: indicate interest for posted dates
    q_signal_interest --> q_interest_alt: propose alternative dates
    q_signal_interest --> q_no_interest: no response in 72 hours
    q_interest_confirm --> q_rank_select: select highest ranked interested watson
    q_interest_alt --> q_rank_select: select highest ranked interested watson
    q_rank_select --> q_selected: watson is highest ranked
    q_rank_select --> q_not_selected: watson is not highest ranked
    q_selected --> q_confirm_check: watson notified, must confirm
    q_confirm_check --> q_lead_confirmed: watson confirms participation
    q_confirm_check --> q_fallback: watson does not confirm in 72h
    q_fallback --> q_rank_select: select next highest ranked watson
    q_lead_confirmed --> [*]: lead senior watson assigned
    q_not_selected --> [*]: can still compete as regular watson
    q_no_interest --> [*]: can still compete as regular watson
    q_ineligible --> [*]: not eligible for senior watson

    note right of q_check_days
        INV-001: Requires >= 28 contest-days (USDC-only contests excluded)
        INV-002: Requires >= 25% of average leaderboard points of top 5 senior watsons
    end note

    note right of q_rank_select
        INV-003: Selection is strictly by ranking order among interested seniors
        INV-004: If audit scheduled > 72h in advance, reconfirmation required
    end note
